sequenceDiagram
    participant Agent as Agent
    participant SDK as SDK
    participant Store as Stored history + notes
    SDK->>Agent: Context warning on a model request
    Agent->>Store: Save notes with existing tools
    Store-->>Agent: Notes saved
    Agent->>SDK: condense(message_to_future_self)
    SDK->>Store: Save action, request and tool result
    SDK->>Store: Commit Condensation reset record
    Note over SDK,Store: Old events remain stored
    SDK-->>Agent: Fresh view: notice + real tool exchange
    Agent->>Store: Read notes
    Store-->>Agent: Saved state and next steps
    Note over Agent: Continue the user's work
